# Hydri scope gate

Always on for implementation, audit, refactor, UI, workflow, and validation. This rule applies even when the user does not explicitly mention "Hydri checkpoint" or "chave de ignição".

Before claiming 🟢 on any implementation, run the autopilot gate with the task scope and mode.

## Mandatory command

```bash
npm run hydri:gate
```

Scope and mode are **inferred from changed files** when omitted. Override when mixed or ambiguous:

```bash
npm run hydri:gate -- --scope=<scope> --mode=<mode>
```

Examples: `--scope=minhas-cargas --mode=mobile`, `--scope=workflow --mode=workflow`, `--scope=cargas --mode=mobile`.

Full spec: `docs/agents/HYDRI-AUTOPILOT-GATE.md`

## Scope boundaries (FAIL without allowlist)

| Scope | Do not touch |
|-------|----------------|
| `minhas-cargas` | Public `/cargas`, `public-cargas-*`, shared marketplace card coupling |
| `cargas` | `/minhas-cargas` owned flows without explicit scope |
| `workflow` | Any `src/app/`, `src/features/`, `src/shared/`, `messages/` product UI |
| `mobile` mode | Desktop-only paths (`desktop-cargo-map`, `operations-board` desktop) |
| `desktop` mode | Mobile shell, BottomNav, `public-cargas-mobile`, owned-cargo mobile |

Use `--allow=path-substring` only with documented justification in proof.

## Success criteria

- **FAIL** from any mandatory gate run → **🔴 Para agora** — fix before human review. **Forbidden:** 🟢, "Pode seguir", "Worked", "concluído", "sucesso", or equivalent success language in Captain closeout or proof.
- **WARN** from any mandatory gate run → **🟡 Segue com cuidado** max — never 🟢.
- **PASS** from **all** mandatory gate runs → still run lint, typecheck, check:i18n, build; tests alone are not enough for 🟢.

## Closing protocol (mandatory)

Before Captain closeout, run every gate required for the task (default: `npm run hydri:gate`; governance/workflow tasks also run `--scope=workflow --mode=workflow` when the diff is dirty or mixed).

| Gate output | Max Captain closeout | Max **Result** | Forbidden phrases |
|-------------|----------------------|----------------|-------------------|
| Any **FAIL** | 🔴 Para agora | Did not work | "Pode seguir", 🟢, success/concluído |
| Any **WARN**, no FAIL | 🟡 Segue com cuidado | Partial | 🟢, "Pode seguir" |
| All **PASS** + validations | 🟢 Pode seguir (if proof sufficient) | Worked | — |

**Governance-only task on a dirty branch:** when rules/docs/scripts were created correctly but the tree still has legitimate product FAILs, close with 🔴 and say: **"Governança criada, mas branch atual segue bloqueada por FAIL legítimo no gate."** Do not claim the branch is ready.

Record gate command(s), scope/mode, and **STATUS FINAL** line in proof **Commands run** / **Objective evidence**.

## Forbidden without explicit user task

- Install dependencies
- Commit or push
- Mass rename legacy paths
- Delete legacy automatically
- Edit `src/app/globals.scss` for feature work
